{"unit":5,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 5","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 5 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Right now</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 17&ndash;20: can/could, Present Continuous, shopping. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u5\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ drive — she has a licence.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">cans</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ ski when I was five.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">can't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">didn't could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">couldn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ read at the age of four.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">cans</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">can</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She is ___ a red scarf.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">wear</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">wears</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wearing</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">They ___ dancing right now.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">Look! It ___ raining.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">does</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ jeans and a T-shirt today.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">wear</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am wearing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">wearing</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">She usually ___ the bus, but today she is walking.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is taking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">take</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">takes</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ the answer. (know — right now)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am knowing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">know</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">knows</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ is this jumper?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">often</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">many</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Can I ___ it on?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">try</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">trying</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tries</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">Do you have it in a bigger ___?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">size</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">price</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">colour</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">I'm just ___, thanks.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">looked</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">looking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">look</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Can I pay by ___?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">money</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">price</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">card</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">___ shoes are nice. (here, near me)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">That</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">This</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">These</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Change to the past: I can't ski. (when I was five)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I couldn't ski when I was five.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Say it about NOW: He wears a suit.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He is wearing a suit.|He's wearing a suit.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You are wearing my jacket.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are you wearing my jacket?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the price of the scarf.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much is the scarf?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She cans drive.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She can drive.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: I am knowing the answer.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I know the answer.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}